<h2 id="when" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">1. When this applies</h2>

User message includes **`pgtestcom`** (whole token).

**Parse (do this first):**

| Piece | How it appears | Default if omitted |
|-------|----------------|--------------------|
| **`<list_of_scopes>`** | `scopes:[a,b]`, `scopes: a, b`, bare catalog names after `pgtestcom` | **All 23 non-conj catalog scopes** (scoreboard §1 / `pgbattest` catalog) |
| **`<list_of_runs>`** | `vs:[§6.34,§6.35]`, `vs 6.34 6.35`, `compare:6.33,6.34` | **One** baseline = **last recorded tip** on the scoreboard (§2 timeline newest real row / highest `§6.xx` with a harness log) |

Warn on unknown scope names; intersect with the catalog. Do **not** invent conjugation / PLGW scopes.

