<h2 id="examples" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">7. Examples</h2>

```text
pgtestcom
pgtestcom scopes:[places:gentilicos-state, numbers:cardinals, inanimate:suffix-rule-binding]
pgtestcom scopes: contractions:blending, numbers:ordinals  vs:[§6.34, §6.35]
pgtestcom vs 6.35
pgtestcom places:countries, places:gentilicos-city compare:6.33,6.34,6.35
```

Agent behavior:

- `pgtestcom` → full-23 `pgbattest` → new §6.xx vs last tip only → scoreboard + freshman table.
- `pgtestcom scopes:[…]` → subset campaign; compare those scopes to last tip (overlap).
- `pgtestcom … vs:[§6.34,§6.35]` → subset or full as scoped; multi-column compare.

