<h2 id="related" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">8. Related rules</h2>

| Rule | Owns |
|------|------|
| **`pgbattest`** | Door budgets, fix→reinvoke when improving a fail |
| **`pgjudge`** | Short live A/B flake-vs-fix after `AGENT_JUDGE` |
| **`pgpbp`** | Deep produce→verify→gate play-by-play for a **recorded** fail |
| **`gitacp`** | Commit/push scoreboard edits when asked |
| **`opslog`** | `ops/run-logs/` conventions |

**Ineffective (avoid):**

- Treating `pgtestcom` as silent “run only” with no scoreboard edit.
- Comparing against an undocumented chat run not on the scoreboard.
- Auto-opening `pgpbp` for every fail (offer only if the user wants autopsy).
- Committing the scoreboard without `gitacp`.
